@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam ArrowColor #0b7a75
skinparam ComponentBorderColor #0b7a75
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor #6b7280
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #f3f4f6
skinparam NoteBorderColor #9ca3af
skinparam ClassBorderColor #0b7a75
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor #ffffff

title What ChatHealthyLib gives every service, and what a concrete tool has to supply in return

package "chathealthy_lib" {

  abstract class ChatHealthyTool {
    {static} TOOL_NAME : ClassVar[str]
    {static} Request : ClassVar[Type[BaseModel]]
    {static} Response : ClassVar[Type[BaseModel]]
    --
    {abstract} + run(deps, request) : Response
    + run_and_log(deps, request) : Response
    - __init_subclass__()
  }

  class ChatHealthyException {
    + mode : str
    + message : str
    + server : str | None
    + component : str | None
    + exception : Exception | None
    + context : dict
    + construction_stack : str
  }

  class ChatHealthyLoggingService {
    + debug(msg, *args, exc, if_not_debug_log)
    + info(msg, *args, exc, if_not_debug_log)
    + warning(msg, *args, exc, if_not_debug_log)
    + error(msg, *args, exc, if_not_debug_log)
    + critical(msg, *args, exc, if_not_debug_log)
    + exception(msg, *args, exc, if_not_debug_log)
  }

  class ChatHealthyMongoUtilities {
    + getConnection(identity, cluster, host="") : TimedClient
  }

  class AgentDeps <<dataclass>> {
    + user_object : UserObject
    + session_token : SessionToken
    + mongo_frontend
    + server_env : str
    + stream : StreamSink
  }
}

package "SharedServices" {
  class UniversalNavigationTool {
    TOOL_NAME = "universal_navigation"
    Request = op + payload
    Response = kind + result
    --
    + run(deps, request)
    + handle_gate(gate_req) : GateResponse
  }

  class UtteranceManagerTool {
    TOOL_NAME
    Request = trigger_type + reason
    Response
    --
    + run(deps, request)
  }
}

Exception <|-- ChatHealthyException
ChatHealthyTool <|-- UniversalNavigationTool
ChatHealthyTool <|-- UtteranceManagerTool

ChatHealthyTool ..> AgentDeps : run(deps, ...)
ChatHealthyTool ..> ChatHealthyException : raises when a subclass\nomits a class attribute
ChatHealthyLoggingService ..> ChatHealthyException : exc= must be one

note right of ChatHealthyTool #f3f4f6
  A subclass supplies three class attributes and one
  method. __init_subclass__ refuses the class at import
  if any attribute is missing, so a tool cannot be half
  declared and discovered at dispatch time.

  run_and_log records the invocation on the session
  whether the run returned or raised. The run used to sit
  outside the guard, so a tool that raised appended
  nothing and the action log simply stopped.
end note

note bottom of ChatHealthyMongoUtilities #f3f4f6
  No connection string and no password. The certificate is
  the credential: identity selects the X.509 cert and
  therefore the MongoDB user and its grants. There is
  deliberately no fallback, because a fallback to a shared
  credential makes the whole model decorative.
end note

note bottom of ChatHealthyException #f3f4f6
  Catch sites discriminate on mode, never on type.
  External exceptions keep their native type until a
  boundary converts them, and the conversion carries the
  original in exception= so the mode says what kind of
  failure it was and the original says what failed.
end note

@enduml
